WEBVTT

00:02.980 --> 00:05.450
The party will be held here.

00:05.450 --> 00:09.090
My grandfather's party will be in four 
days and my own will be two after that.

00:09.090 --> 00:10.570
Grandfather.

00:11.000 --> 00:13.150
Sister Noa and her friends have arrived.

00:13.460 --> 00:15.660
Oh! Cliff. Noir.

00:15.660 --> 00:19.240
And Miss Bear as well as Fina, was it?

00:19.240 --> 00:22.360
Thank you for coming for the sake 
of my granddaughter.

00:22.360 --> 00:24.990
It has been a while, Grandfather Gran.

00:24.990 --> 00:30.340
Th-Th-Thank you very much for 
i-inviting us to such a grand event.

00:30.700 --> 00:33.170
<i>Why was I the only one 
he didn't call by name?</i>

00:33.170 --> 00:36.450
It's good to see you healthily 
leading the way as the family head

00:36.450 --> 00:38.710
even at the age of fifty, Grandfather Gran.

00:38.710 --> 00:41.610
That's because I still can't 
depend on my successor.

00:41.610 --> 00:43.950
That's going a bit too far, Dad.

00:44.480 --> 00:46.190
Father. Mother.

00:46.190 --> 00:49.050
I am Misa-na's father, Leonardo.

00:49.050 --> 00:51.420
I'm so glad to meet you, Miss Bear.

00:51.420 --> 00:53.110
H-Hello.

00:53.110 --> 00:54.910
And you must be Fina.

00:54.910 --> 00:57.870
My daughter knows nothing of the 
world, but please get along with her.

00:57.870 --> 00:59.160
Y-Yes!

00:59.160 --> 01:01.320
It's been a while, Botts.

01:01.320 --> 01:03.900
Looks like I can look forward to 
the food at the party with you here.

01:03.900 --> 01:06.510
Of course ya... you can, Lord Cliff.

01:06.510 --> 01:08.200
I've discussed things with Lord Gran

01:08.200 --> 01:11.270
and prepared a menu that 
won't lose to the royal table.

01:11.270 --> 01:16.260
Botts is our family's head chef. 
His cooking is very delicious.

01:16.260 --> 01:18.220
I see. Delicious food.

01:18.220 --> 01:20.360
So, you're Miss Bear.

01:20.360 --> 01:21.750
So what if I am?

01:21.750 --> 01:23.080
Thanks.

01:23.080 --> 01:27.330
The savior of Lord Gran and Lady Misa-na 
should be considered our savior, too.

01:27.330 --> 01:30.940
I'll work hard to serve you 
the best food I can at the party.

01:31.750 --> 01:34.030
<i>Looks like Misa and Mr. Gran 
are loved by their people.</i>

01:34.570 --> 01:37.360
<i>It'd be great if all nobles were like this.</i>

03:14.260 --> 03:16.000
What do you think, Fina?

03:16.000 --> 03:19.080
This is the liveliest place in Sheelin.

03:19.080 --> 03:23.220
Yes, all the people and shops make me 
feel like I'm in the royal capital!

03:23.850 --> 03:26.470
Crimonia is quite a lively city as well!

03:27.040 --> 03:28.810
You're so silly, Sister Noa.

03:30.680 --> 03:35.390
It's good to have fun, but 
make sure to stay close to me.

03:35.390 --> 03:39.360
That's what you promised to get 
permission to go out like this.

03:39.360 --> 03:41.420
Of course! I'll hug you 
the whole time if I must!

03:41.420 --> 03:44.800
I will not stray from Miss Yuna! Hugs!

03:44.800 --> 03:46.950
M-Me, too! Hugs!

03:46.950 --> 03:49.580
I shall hug her even more! Hugs!

03:49.580 --> 03:51.180
Me, too! Hugs!

03:51.180 --> 03:52.980
Hug!

03:52.980 --> 03:54.100
Hug!

03:55.550 --> 03:57.320
Hug!

03:57.630 --> 03:58.580
A bear?

03:58.580 --> 03:59.210
A bear, right?

03:59.210 --> 04:00.980
Why is a bear in the city?

04:00.980 --> 04:02.930
Are the girls being attacked by the bear?

04:02.930 --> 04:05.640
Are the girls attacking the bear?

04:06.300 --> 04:07.630
Really?

04:11.910 --> 04:13.020
Well, whatever.

04:36.750 --> 04:42.410
It's so fun to freely visit various stores 
and eat so many different things.

04:42.410 --> 04:45.720
Yes! It reminds me of our 
time in the royal capital!

04:45.720 --> 04:47.060
I agree!

04:47.060 --> 04:50.640
I've been forbidden to 
go outside recently, so...

04:50.640 --> 04:53.850
So there are some strict 
rules in place for you.

04:53.850 --> 04:56.400
Makes sense since you're 
a real-life noble lady.

04:56.400 --> 04:57.980
Please wait, Miss Yuna!

04:57.980 --> 04:59.590
A real-life example!

04:59.590 --> 05:02.970
There is a real-life example 
right in front of you!

05:02.970 --> 05:05.360
Let's go all out, then!

05:05.360 --> 05:10.150
After all, w-we're all here with you today.

05:10.150 --> 05:11.440
Fina...

05:11.440 --> 05:12.180
Yes!

05:12.180 --> 05:13.250
Hey, now.

05:13.250 --> 05:15.870
I smell the stench of poverty around here.

05:17.580 --> 05:20.750
Just like I thought, it's Misa-na.

05:20.750 --> 05:25.080
Why is a poor noble from the eastern 
district in a place like this?

05:25.080 --> 05:26.030
And...

05:26.030 --> 05:28.800
Why are you with a crazy 
woman dressed as a bear?

05:28.800 --> 05:31.430
Oh! Giving your pet a walk?!

05:31.850 --> 05:33.300
<i>This is bad.</i>

05:33.300 --> 05:35.640
<i>I really want to punch him.</i>

05:35.640 --> 05:40.020
<i>The safety of the girls is top priority. 
I shouldn't blow this out of proportion.</i>

05:40.920 --> 05:43.070
This is why I can't stand the poor...

05:40.920 --> 05:45.190
<i>Even so, he's saying really rude things 
to the city lord's granddaughter.</i>

05:45.190 --> 05:46.320
<i>Is he stupid?</i>

05:46.320 --> 05:49.140
Hey, Misa-na. Where's my thanks?

05:49.140 --> 05:52.900
I came all this way to attend 
old man Gran's birthday party.

05:52.900 --> 05:56.580
Shouldn't you lower your head 
and thank me profusely?

05:57.510 --> 05:59.540
<i>Mister Gran's birthday party...</i>

05:59.540 --> 06:02.260
<i>I see. He's a noble, too.</i>

06:02.260 --> 06:03.350
<i>Even though he's stupid.</i>

06:03.350 --> 06:07.800
Hey, Misa-na. I can even 
attend to your party.

06:08.380 --> 06:10.040
As expected of you, Lord Randle!

06:10.040 --> 06:12.090
You're even kind to poverty-stricken nobles!

06:12.830 --> 06:14.100
You don't need to come.

06:15.410 --> 06:17.290
You don't need to come!

06:17.290 --> 06:22.960
Do you know your place? 
Your family is going to fall soon!

06:23.570 --> 06:26.260
You should understand your situation

06:26.260 --> 06:29.080
and suck up to me while 
you still have a chance.

06:29.080 --> 06:30.610
Yup. That's enough.

06:30.610 --> 06:32.300
Who the hell are you?!

06:32.300 --> 06:35.700
Do you think a weirdo dressed as a bear 
can get in my way without any consequences?!

06:35.700 --> 06:38.410
I can, since I'm Misa's bodyguard.

06:38.790 --> 06:41.750
A bodyguard? Dressed like that?

06:41.750 --> 06:46.770
A strong guy like this is 
what you call a bodyguard!

06:53.140 --> 06:55.890
Sister Yuna is stronger!

06:55.890 --> 06:56.560
Lady Misa.

06:55.890 --> 06:56.560
Misa...

06:56.560 --> 06:59.710
That bear is strong? Don't make me laugh!

06:59.710 --> 07:02.270
I'm the one that wants to laugh.

07:02.270 --> 07:04.970
You can't even talk to a little girl

07:04.970 --> 07:08.350
without a strong-looking bodyguard 
and a group of minions following you.

07:08.350 --> 07:11.030
Just how old are you, wittle boy?

07:11.030 --> 07:16.420
If you're that scared, you should go home 
and suck lunch from your mamma's tiddies.

07:16.420 --> 07:18.370
H-How dare you!

07:18.370 --> 07:20.420
Shit! Lemme go!

07:20.420 --> 07:22.480
Huh? Were you trying to do something?

07:22.480 --> 07:23.220
Shit!

07:23.220 --> 07:24.880
Hey! Brad!

07:26.000 --> 07:27.170
Oops.

07:28.800 --> 07:29.550
Ouch!

07:33.300 --> 07:34.890
How dare you!

07:34.890 --> 07:39.160
It's your fault for giving the order and 
your bodyguard's fault for suddenly cutting in.

07:39.160 --> 07:42.540
Brad! Beat that bear woman down!

07:42.540 --> 07:44.560
Please consider our surroundings, 
Lord Randle.

07:44.560 --> 07:45.990
What's going on?

07:45.990 --> 07:47.290
Is everything okay?

07:47.290 --> 07:48.290
You better remember this!

07:48.290 --> 07:51.350
Don't think you can get away 
with going against me!

07:57.450 --> 07:59.160
You did well.

08:02.190 --> 08:03.960
I'm sorry, Fina.

08:03.960 --> 08:06.900
You had to experience something 
like this after coming all this way...

08:06.900 --> 08:09.010
Please don't worry about it!

08:09.010 --> 08:11.430
I'm more worried about you, Lady Misa.

08:12.350 --> 08:16.030
I'm sorry Misa. I couldn't 
do anything to help you.

08:16.030 --> 08:17.580
Sister Noa...

08:17.580 --> 08:22.860
It's true that Father told me not to 
involve myself with the Salbard family.

08:22.860 --> 08:27.100
Even so, I couldn't say anything 
because I was so scared.

08:27.100 --> 08:29.320
Even though he said such 
terrible things to you...

08:29.320 --> 08:31.380
I am so upset with myself.

08:32.130 --> 08:34.610
I understand your feelings, Sister Noa.

08:34.610 --> 08:36.790
Don't worry. Don't worry.

08:36.790 --> 08:40.220
This is why Cliff had me 
come along as a bodyguard.

08:40.220 --> 08:41.080
Miss Yuna...

08:41.080 --> 08:45.170
That snobby guy was a noble, huh?

08:45.850 --> 08:50.130
Yes. He's from the Salbard family, 
the family of the city lord of Sheelin City.

08:50.130 --> 08:52.540
I see. The city lord...

08:52.540 --> 08:53.430
City lord?!

08:53.430 --> 08:56.240
Huh? But isn't the lord Lady Misa's...

08:56.640 --> 08:59.150
Grandfather rules over the eastern district

08:59.150 --> 09:01.770
and the Salbard family rules 
over the western district...

09:02.370 --> 09:05.500
The city of Sheelin has two city lords.

09:10.000 --> 09:11.730
I heard what happened.

09:11.730 --> 09:14.610
It seems you met that brat 
from the Salbard family.

09:14.610 --> 09:17.450
Yeah, he was really hostile.

09:17.450 --> 09:21.170
First, Yuna, allow me to thank you 
for protecting the children.

09:21.170 --> 09:25.910
I'd like to thank you as well as apologize. 
We have caused trouble for our guest.

09:25.910 --> 09:27.750
It's fine. She's my friend.

09:28.120 --> 09:31.210
<i>Even though they're both nobles, 
they're so different.</i>

09:31.210 --> 09:33.090
How are the children?

09:33.090 --> 09:36.030
Well, Misa seems pretty depressed.

09:36.030 --> 09:40.000
Fina and Noa are working 
hard to cheer her up.

09:40.000 --> 09:43.060
It seems we've caused trouble 
for the children as well.

09:43.480 --> 09:48.190
I hoped the children could just have fun 
and leave any difficulties to the adults.

09:48.730 --> 09:53.690
By difficulties, are you talking about 
the fact that one city has two city lords?

09:53.690 --> 09:55.390
Did the Noa and Misa tell you about it?

09:55.390 --> 09:56.650
Just a bit.

09:57.040 --> 10:01.500
A long time ago, the king 
before the previous king

10:01.500 --> 10:04.940
split the city of Sheelin equally between 
two nobles that contributed to the kingdom.

10:05.510 --> 10:10.130
Because of that, there are two 
city lords ruling over one city.

10:10.130 --> 10:12.590
Was that old king stupid?

10:12.590 --> 10:13.970
It's just as you say.

10:13.970 --> 10:15.050
Don't insult royalty.

10:16.700 --> 10:19.850
Both families got along back then,

10:19.850 --> 10:21.550
but our relationship fell apart

10:21.550 --> 10:25.780
after the head of the Salbard 
family changed a few years ago.

10:25.780 --> 10:28.730
They continue to use various 
means to cause trouble with us.

10:28.730 --> 10:30.690
Just like they provoked Misa?

10:31.050 --> 10:32.350
Even if we send complaints,

10:32.350 --> 10:35.690
they respond that there's no need to 
interfere with fights amongst children.

10:35.690 --> 10:37.090
That's not all.

10:37.090 --> 10:39.670
They bought off the merchant 
guild's guild master

10:39.670 --> 10:42.950
to obtain better economic 
benefits for the western district.

10:42.950 --> 10:46.420
Because of that, the economic activity 
of the eastern district has stalled,

10:46.420 --> 10:48.460
decreasing tax revenue.

10:48.900 --> 10:54.170
They retorted that the merchants were 
free to do business wherever they wanted.

10:54.560 --> 10:56.730
The merchant guild again?!

10:56.730 --> 10:58.560
They caused trouble in Mileela, too.

10:58.560 --> 11:01.180
Are they an evil organization or something?

11:02.350 --> 11:08.250
Since the tax revenue has decreased, 
His Majesty may dismiss our status as city lords.

11:08.250 --> 11:12.230
If that happens, the Salbard family will 
become the sole city lord of Sheelin.

11:12.230 --> 11:16.230
Most of the powers within the city have 
already taken shelter under their family.

11:16.600 --> 11:18.940
The situation seems pretty bad...

11:18.940 --> 11:22.370
That's the reason for this birthday party.

11:22.370 --> 11:24.410
It's to show the powers within the city

11:24.410 --> 11:28.220
that the Farrengram family is still 
standing strong and gathering allies.

11:28.220 --> 11:32.670
I'm attending to show that the Foschurose 
family stands by this family as well.

11:32.670 --> 11:37.300
I see. That's why you spoke 
the way you did that night.

11:37.300 --> 11:39.590
There was no reason to hide anything,

11:39.590 --> 11:42.330
but we wanted you and 
the girls to enjoy the party

11:42.330 --> 11:45.030
without worrying about 
the intentions of the adults.

11:45.030 --> 11:47.390
Well, we ended up involving 
all of you in the end.

11:47.660 --> 11:50.960
Will a party be enough to fix the problem?

11:50.960 --> 11:55.230
Well, if it's only Misa, I can raise her 
if her family becomes homeless.

11:55.230 --> 11:57.460
Don't make jokes that tempt fate.

11:57.460 --> 11:59.680
No, I feel much at ease.

11:59.680 --> 12:03.340
No one hates a welcoming atmosphere.

12:03.340 --> 12:05.440
If we feed them some delicious food,

12:05.440 --> 12:08.290
I'm sure they'll at least consider 
listening to what we have to say.

12:08.590 --> 12:12.250
Well, the quality of food offered to 
guests is one way to show a noble's status.

12:12.720 --> 12:13.710
I see...

12:14.140 --> 12:18.420
<i>I guess that's why politicians and 
rich people have such grand parties.</i>

12:18.420 --> 12:22.920
Botts was the sous-chef of a top-class 
restaurant in the royal capital.

12:22.920 --> 12:25.800
His skills would put him among 
the top five chefs in the capital.

12:25.800 --> 12:30.270
His cooking is a powerful weapon in itself.

12:30.270 --> 12:33.350
Everything Mister Botts has 
made has been delicious.

12:34.810 --> 12:36.020
Lord Gran!

12:36.400 --> 12:38.110
P-Please forgive my rudeness!

12:38.110 --> 12:40.070
It's fine. What's wrong, Meishun?

12:40.420 --> 12:43.650
The head chef... Mister Botts
 is severely injured!

12:44.310 --> 12:45.210
What?!

12:45.990 --> 12:47.300
Huh?

12:49.830 --> 12:51.530
I'm very sorry!

12:52.170 --> 12:56.960
I let my guard down and caused 
everyone so much trouble!

12:56.960 --> 12:58.680
Rest for now.

12:58.680 --> 13:02.400
You've been healed with magic, but the
 strength in your arm hasn't returned.

13:02.400 --> 13:04.100
But there isn't much time until the party!

13:04.100 --> 13:09.010
Botts, please rest and make us 
delicious food again in the future.

13:10.060 --> 13:12.430
Lady Misa-na! Lord Gran!

13:19.190 --> 13:21.320
Mister Gran and Misa are kind people.

13:21.320 --> 13:24.490
You, too. Thanks for using 
your healing magic.

13:24.490 --> 13:28.080
I was able to heal his wounds, but he 
won't be able to cook for a while, right?

13:28.080 --> 13:28.940
Yeah.

13:28.940 --> 13:30.950
The culprit that attacked Mister Botts...

13:31.300 --> 13:33.410
We have no proof or witnesses.

13:33.410 --> 13:37.000
However, I'm sure it was the Salbard family.

13:37.000 --> 13:42.550
It looks like they want the party to fail 
and finish Grandfather Gran off for good.

13:42.550 --> 13:44.230
What will happen to the party?

13:44.230 --> 13:47.540
There are no chefs in town 
as talented as Botts.

13:47.540 --> 13:51.340
Even if there were, they would have been 
bought off by the Salbard family.

13:51.340 --> 13:52.340
That's why...

13:53.000 --> 13:55.580
Lord Cliff, we have finished preparations.

13:55.580 --> 13:57.440
We can leave at any time.

13:57.440 --> 13:59.660
I know I'm asking a lot from the two of you.

13:59.660 --> 14:01.550
Yes! Leave it to us!

14:02.830 --> 14:05.630
I'll have them bring 
a replacement chef from Crimonia.

14:05.630 --> 14:07.610
They should barely make it in time 
if they run their horses.

14:07.610 --> 14:11.830
Should I go, then? You know how 
fast Kumayuru and Kumakyu are.

14:11.830 --> 14:14.250
Thanks, but I told you

14:14.250 --> 14:17.040
that I'm hoping the children can 
enjoy the party without any worries.

14:17.040 --> 14:19.420
Please stay by Noa and the girls.

14:19.900 --> 14:21.180
Got it.

14:24.090 --> 14:28.310
They are so cute, no matter how 
many times I see them or hug them!

14:28.310 --> 14:30.350
Nuzzle. Nuzzle.

14:30.350 --> 14:32.010
Nuzzle! Nuzzle!

14:32.010 --> 14:34.460
So very cute!

14:39.400 --> 14:40.630
Misa?

14:41.660 --> 14:46.400
I'm very happy to see 
Kumayuru and Kumakyu again.

14:46.400 --> 14:49.380
On top of that, they're so small and cute.

14:50.260 --> 14:57.090
However, my family's problems have caused 
you all trouble and Botts even got hurt...

14:57.090 --> 14:59.050
Even so, I'm just sitting here...

14:59.050 --> 15:01.430
You don't need to worry about it, Misa.

15:01.430 --> 15:03.440
It's all that little shit's...

15:03.440 --> 15:06.240
That shitty rich kid and his family's fault!

15:06.240 --> 15:09.660
Miss Yuna, was there any meaning 
to rephrasing your words just now? {Note: In other words, Yuna rephrased her words to "not sound as bad" but then it still sounded just as bad.}

15:09.660 --> 15:11.620
Sister Yuna...

15:11.620 --> 15:12.610
But...

15:12.610 --> 15:15.100
Please don't make that face, Lady Misa.

15:15.100 --> 15:18.680
Look, you're making Kumayuru 
and Kumakyu worried, too.

15:18.680 --> 15:20.300
Fina...

15:20.300 --> 15:24.380
Um, may I squeeze you Kumakyu?

15:26.630 --> 15:28.070
So cute.

15:30.150 --> 15:32.490
Sorry! It's me. Can I come in?

15:32.490 --> 15:33.740
Father?

15:33.740 --> 15:34.930
Sure.

15:38.080 --> 15:39.290
What's wrong?

15:39.290 --> 15:42.420
Rabon and Gouges were attacked 
on their way to Crimonia.

15:43.860 --> 15:45.980
It seems like they're 
monitoring our movements.

15:47.580 --> 15:50.310
They were attacked by a volley of arrows 
right outside the city.

15:50.310 --> 15:55.590
Like Botts, they managed to survive, 
but they can't go anywhere for the time being.

15:57.940 --> 15:59.290
Hey, the culprit is probably...

15:59.290 --> 16:01.600
Highly likely, but there's no evidence.

16:01.600 --> 16:05.740
Yuna, it's embarrassing to ask after 
telling you I didn't need your help.

16:05.740 --> 16:10.780
I owe Grandfather Gran a lot. 
Please lend me your strength.

16:11.140 --> 16:12.030
Miss Yuna...

16:12.030 --> 16:13.580
Yuna Sis.

16:13.580 --> 16:14.700
Leave it to me.

16:14.700 --> 16:17.050
That noble is really pissing me off.

16:17.050 --> 16:18.330
Please stop!

16:20.040 --> 16:21.090
Misa?

16:21.090 --> 16:26.650
Botts and Lord Cliff's bodyguards have 
already gotten hurt because of my family.

16:26.650 --> 16:30.140
If you got hurt on top of that...

16:30.140 --> 16:34.260
I don't want anyone to get hurt 
because of us anymore!

16:37.470 --> 16:40.180
Misa, you're such a kind girl.

16:40.180 --> 16:42.270
But there's no need to worry.

16:42.270 --> 16:45.970
You said it yourself, I'm stronger than them.

16:46.620 --> 16:48.270
Yuna, about the chef, 
if you go to Crimonia...

16:48.270 --> 16:52.990
It's fine. I have a person in mind. 
I'll bring a fantastic chef over.

16:56.350 --> 16:58.660
Have a safe trip, Yuna Sis.

16:59.050 --> 17:02.140
Yeah. Take care of Noa and Misa for me.

17:02.450 --> 17:07.380
<b>Bear, Getting Motivated</b>

17:02.450 --> 17:07.380
<b>Bear, Getting Motivated</b>

17:09.420 --> 17:12.380
Looks like they're not monitoring this area.

17:13.650 --> 17:17.750
<i>First, I'll set up a transfer gate 
where no one can see.</i>

17:17.750 --> 17:19.350
<i>Then, I'll head to...</i>

17:26.490 --> 17:28.480
Sorry for the sudden visit, Mrs. Ellalaura.

17:28.480 --> 17:32.300
I have some business with the castle. 
I was hoping you'd contact them for me.

17:32.300 --> 17:36.070
Oh, my. You could have just 
visited the castle directly.

17:36.070 --> 17:39.710
No, I needed to go through 
the proper channels this time.

17:39.710 --> 17:41.720
I want to make a direct request to the king.

17:41.720 --> 17:43.730
Come to think of it, 
I received a letter from Cliff

17:43.730 --> 17:48.250
saying you were attending Lord 
Gran and Misa's birthday party...

17:49.070 --> 17:50.590
Something must have happened.

17:50.590 --> 17:53.540
It's not a very fun story.

17:56.870 --> 17:59.350
The Salbard and Farrengram families...

17:59.350 --> 18:01.370
Goodness, Grandfather.

18:01.370 --> 18:04.310
My predecessor has created 
quite the headache. {Note: Not positive. I'm pretty sure this word is for ANY person who has worked before you? Otherwise it should be "my predecessor's predecessor" here.}

18:04.310 --> 18:08.950
Yes. I wish he considered the problems 
he'd create for future generations.

18:08.950 --> 18:12.950
Even so, scuffles among 
the nobles are commonplace.

18:12.950 --> 18:16.900
Well, the difficult situation in Sheelin 
is definitely an unusual one.

18:16.900 --> 18:20.680
<i>As expected, they knew 
about the issues in Sheelin.</i>

18:20.680 --> 18:22.240
<i>Anyways, who are those two?</i>

18:22.240 --> 18:25.450
Come to think of it, this is 
the first time you've met them.

18:25.940 --> 18:27.980
This is my prime minister, Zang.

18:27.980 --> 18:30.100
It is nice to meet you.

18:30.100 --> 18:34.510
I would like to thank you for saving 
the people of the royal capital

18:34.510 --> 18:35.920
from the evil schemes of Ghoulzam.

18:36.280 --> 18:38.330
Nice to meet you, Miss Bear.

18:38.330 --> 18:41.140
I am King Forot's heir, Ernat.

18:41.140 --> 18:44.720
<i>Heir? Does that mean he's 
this country's prince?</i>

18:44.720 --> 18:46.720
<i>In other words, Princess 
Flora's big brother...</i>

18:46.720 --> 18:49.580
Thank you for taking care of my 
father, mother, and little sister.

18:49.580 --> 18:50.500
Especially my father.

18:50.500 --> 18:54.450
He loves to push all his work onto me and 
run over to you every time you visit...

18:55.720 --> 18:58.240
<i>His eyes are definitely not smiling...</i>

18:58.240 --> 19:01.070
<i>But that's not my fault, right?</i>

19:02.530 --> 19:04.630
So, what is your request?

19:04.630 --> 19:07.220
I owe you, so I'd like 
to fulfill your request.

19:06.160 --> 19:09.850
Even so, we can't directly get involved 
in disputes amongst the nobles.

19:09.850 --> 19:12.850
It's a pity that their 
chef was attacked, but...

19:12.850 --> 19:14.900
There are rumors that the Salbard family

19:14.900 --> 19:18.830
is involved in embezzlement, 
blackmail, and violence,

19:18.830 --> 19:21.800
but we have no proof.

19:21.800 --> 19:24.140
Well, that's true...

19:24.140 --> 19:27.120
Everyone is mistaken. Yuna's request is...

19:27.120 --> 19:28.780
Can I borrow Mister Zelef?

19:28.780 --> 19:30.810
By Zelef, do you mean <i>that</i> Zelef?

19:30.810 --> 19:34.020
The only Mister Zelef I know is the royal chef.

19:34.550 --> 19:37.730
You didn't come to complain 
about the Salbard family?

19:37.730 --> 19:42.620
Isn't dealing with the power struggles 
between nobles the job of the higher-ups?

19:42.620 --> 19:45.830
I just don't want the party to be canceled.

19:46.200 --> 19:49.140
In the end, aren't you favoring 
the Farrengram family?

19:49.140 --> 19:54.320
The only thing I know is that my friend, 
a kind little girl, is feeling hurt,

19:54.320 --> 19:55.500
and I can't stand it.

19:57.290 --> 19:59.590
You really never change.

19:59.590 --> 20:03.090
As king, I cannot favor one family 
over another on the surface.

20:03.090 --> 20:07.970
So, this will publicly be 
a request from the Foschurose family.

20:07.970 --> 20:09.640
Not a problem.

20:09.640 --> 20:13.270
Our family is already allied 
with the Farrengram family.

20:13.270 --> 20:15.770
The Salbard family won't be suspicious.

20:15.770 --> 20:18.610
So, what does that mean in the end?

20:18.610 --> 20:19.610
I allow it.

20:19.610 --> 20:22.070
Feel free to take Zelef to Sheelin.

20:22.760 --> 20:24.960
I overheard the situation!

20:25.290 --> 20:27.000
M-Mr. Zelef?

20:28.830 --> 20:33.040
The arms of a chef are more 
important than their life!

20:33.410 --> 20:37.000
I cannot forgive anyone who uses 
cowardly tricks to harm such arms!

20:38.150 --> 20:42.550
This is a traitorous action that 
stomps on the sanctity of cooking!

20:45.870 --> 20:48.330
As expected of the huntress 
of food, Miss Yuna!

20:48.330 --> 20:49.850
You understand what I'm saying!

20:49.850 --> 20:51.060
<i>What?!</i>

20:51.060 --> 20:55.130
Well, I'll have to take 
a little trip to Sheelin.

20:55.130 --> 20:56.850
Leave it to me, Your Majesty!

20:57.230 --> 21:00.710
<i>I-Is this guy okay?</i>

21:07.740 --> 21:11.590
Amazing... To think those little 
bears could grow this large.

21:11.590 --> 21:14.490
This is actually their normal size.

21:14.830 --> 21:17.820
Welp, I'll have you ride Kumakyu.

21:17.820 --> 21:22.720
It's probably your first time riding a 
bear, but it's not scary or dangerous.

21:22.720 --> 21:24.500
Then, excuse me.

21:24.500 --> 21:26.900
Please take care of me, Kumakyu.

21:31.410 --> 21:33.350
So impressively meaty...

21:34.810 --> 21:40.280
The perfect ratio of hardness and resilience,
yet still maintains plenty of fat.

21:41.150 --> 21:43.430
Uh, Mr. Zelef?

21:43.430 --> 21:45.610
Your review sounds a little weird...

21:46.160 --> 21:47.350
By the way, Miss Yuna.

21:47.350 --> 21:48.320
Y-Yes? Yeah?

21:48.320 --> 21:50.860
Did you know that in certain countries, 
bear paws are considered...

21:50.860 --> 21:53.360
Yup! Okay! Right! Let's go!

21:53.360 --> 21:56.000
We don't have much time so 
we're traveling at full speed!

23:35.390 --> 23:39.980
<b>Bear, Going Bare</b>

23:35.430 --> 23:39.980
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.850 --> 23:37.500
B-Bear!
